{"id":"mode","lemma":"mode","pos":"noun","rank":1174,"glosses":["method, means, way, mode","mode, mood","mode"],"ipa":"/mɔd/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/bb/Fr-mode.ogg/Fr-mode.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"modes"},"formAudio":{"modes":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/66/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Eihel-modes.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C’est la grande mode.","en":"It's all the rage.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"big","l":"grand"},null]},{"text":"Elle connaît bien les dernières modes.","en":"She knows a lot about the latest fashions.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to know","l":"connaître"},{"g":"well"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"last","l":"dernier"},null]},{"text":"C'est le mode de vie américain.","en":"This is the American way of life.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"life"},{"g":"of or pertaining to…"}]},{"text":"Je me fiche de la mode.","en":"I don't care about fashion.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"to plug in","l":"ficher"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"Ce chapeau est très à la mode.","en":"That hat is very much in fashion.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"hat"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"very"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"a la"]]}]}